/Title (\(SSH\) were open without strict access control, an attacker could attempt "Brute Force" attacks to gain server access.If a firewall is not strictly configured, "Port Scanning" allows hackers to perform "OS Fingerprinting," helping them tailor their attacks to the specific operating system the server is running.)
